WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:01.270
- Is it true Sandi,

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:04.270
you also worked three jobs at one...?

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.103
I mean, how...?

00:00:05.103 --> 00:00:06.630
- I've always worked three jobs.

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.850
'Cause I put him in private school.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.529
I sent him through college.

00:00:10.529 --> 00:00:14.269
He played tennis, which
is not a cheap sport.

00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:15.102
(audience chuckle)

00:00:15.102 --> 00:00:19.236
But, I wanted him to have
everything I didn't have, so.

00:00:19.236 --> 00:00:22.236
(audience applauds)

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.990
- We saw your pride, you know,

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:30.553
just as you beep beep went by.

00:00:30.553 --> 00:00:32.560
(everyone laughs)

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.270
What does it feel like to
have all that hard work

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:36.840
that you put into raising him, pay off?

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.477
I mean, the man he's
become is because of you.

00:00:39.477 --> 00:00:40.310
What's that like?

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.280
- I'm very, very proud
of the man he has become

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.113
because, you know,

00:00:43.113 --> 00:00:47.090
you see so many people that
don't put in the effort

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:48.970
and I just like to see my reward.

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:51.640
Because, when I even see him on camera,

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.520
it could be like a 20-second block,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.270
but I'm just beaming,

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:59.400
because he's doing what
I was wanting to do,

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.297
I went to school for journalism.

00:01:01.297 --> 00:01:04.300
I raised him. He's doing it.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.017
So, I'm living for him.

00:01:06.017 --> 00:01:07.394
(audience applauds)

00:01:07.394 --> 00:01:08.792
(audience whoops)

00:01:08.792 --> 00:01:10.980
- Sandi, is it true you
haven't taken a vacation

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:12.053
in five years?

00:01:13.421 --> 00:01:15.670
- I had a broken ankle.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:17.930
I had to go through four surgeries.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:21.900
So I've been home for
almost four or five years.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.511
This is my nurse right here.

00:01:23.511 --> 00:01:24.620
- [Ross] Oh.

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:29.620
- Well, I heard that you were
interested in going to Cabos.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.320
Is that true?

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:33.170
- Oh my God, that's my favorite place.

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:34.260
- [Drew] Is that your dream place?

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.140
- Yes. That's my dream place.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.000
- [Drew] Have you ever been?

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.360
- Yeah, I have.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.200
But I've always wanted to take him.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.432
- [Drew] So you guys
have never gone together?

00:01:40.432 --> 00:01:42.650
- I've never been out the country before.

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:43.644
- [Drew] Well, pack your bags,

00:01:43.644 --> 00:01:44.477
(Sandi gasps)

00:01:44.477 --> 00:01:45.990
because we are gonna give you

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:47.896
an all inclusive trip -
- [Sandi] Oh my God!

00:01:47.896 --> 00:01:48.729
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:01:48.729 --> 00:01:51.067
- to the brand new Villa La Valencia

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:54.108
Beach Resort and Spa in Cabos!

00:01:54.108 --> 00:01:56.530
- [Sandi] Yes way. Yes way!

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:57.750
We're gonna give you $1,000 spending money

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:58.610
because you know, I don't know,

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:00.730
maybe you need a new suit
and like some chocolates,

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:02.945
and you know, some sunblock
and stuff for that.

00:02:02.945 --> 00:02:03.778
(Sandi laughs)

00:02:03.778 --> 00:02:05.732
- Oh my God. Thank you so much!

00:02:05.732 --> 00:02:07.993
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:02:07.993 --> 00:02:10.076
- [Ross] Congratulations.

00:02:11.377 --> 00:02:13.190
- And let this be the beginning

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.854
of a beautiful friendship please.

00:02:14.854 --> 00:02:15.888
- [Myles] Yes, please.

00:02:15.888 --> 00:02:16.721
- [Ross] Congratulations Sandi.

00:02:16.721 --> 00:02:19.573
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:02:19.573 --> 00:02:20.406
So happy for you!

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:23.479
- Myles and Sandi, welcome to the show!

00:02:23.479 --> 00:02:25.170
It is literally built for you.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.840
Thank you so much. Let's do more.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.246
Let's play, and we wanna
hear all about Cabos.

00:02:29.246 --> 00:02:32.579
(theme music plays out)

